{
 "nodes": [
  {
   "id": "d9aa9bc587d54b7f",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "# THE THREAD OF GOD\n\nself-revelation in eight phases \u00b7 shape of speech at each step",
   "x": 660,
   "y": -280,
   "width": 1000,
   "height": 120,
   "color": "6"
  },
  {
   "id": "99a3cc1f107d4109",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**1 \u00b7 THE VOICE**\n\n*creative speech*\n\nGen 1:1 \u2014 reality is a word\nPs 19:1 \u2014 the heavens declare",
   "x": 0,
   "y": 0,
   "width": 280,
   "height": 220
  },
  {
   "id": "831b5b8c60734d3d",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**2 \u00b7 FACE-TO-FACE**\n\n*personal voice \u2192 law*\n\nEx 33:11 \u00b7 Deut 5:27\nTorah: 1,109 sayings\nthe tabernacle: kavod",
   "x": 330,
   "y": 0,
   "width": 280,
   "height": 220,
   "color": "2"
  },
  {
   "id": "728b302963f14f18",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**3 \u00b7 THE PROPHET**\n\n*\u201cThus saith the LORD\u201d*\n\n3,224 sayings (60%)\nJer 1,030 \u00b7 Ez 792 \u00b7 Is 789\n\u201cI am the LORD\u201d \u00d7101 \u2014 Ez 58",
   "x": 660,
   "y": 0,
   "width": 280,
   "height": 220,
   "color": "1"
  },
  {
   "id": "f5f8a824abc94500",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**4 \u00b7 THE SILENCE**\n\n*kairos waiting*\n\n~400 years\nMalachi \u2192 the Gospels\nthe line goes quiet",
   "x": 990,
   "y": 0,
   "width": 280,
   "height": 220,
   "color": "3"
  },
  {
   "id": "bda38e6dad934977",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**5 \u00b7 THE FLESH**\n\n*the Word, a person*\n\nJohn 1:14 \u00b7 14:9\n2,029 red-letter sayings\n\u201cI am\u201d \u00d782",
   "x": 1320,
   "y": 0,
   "width": 280,
   "height": 220,
   "color": "5"
  },
  {
   "id": "70bbaa5c71de4631",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**6 \u00b7 THE GIFT**\n\n*cross, resurrection, Pentecost*\n\nJohn 6:51 \u2014 flesh for the\nlife of the world\nlaw on the heart; spirit within",
   "x": 1650,
   "y": 0,
   "width": 280,
   "height": 220,
   "color": "1"
  },
  {
   "id": "ba606fc9edaf4f4f",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**7 \u00b7 THE RISEN VOICE**\n\n*the Son keeps speaking*\n\nHeb 1:2 \u00b7 Acts 9, 22, 26\nRev: 31 \u201cAlpha and Omega\u201d sayings",
   "x": 1980,
   "y": 0,
   "width": 280,
   "height": 220,
   "color": "5"
  },
  {
   "id": "5af296b46581408a",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**8 \u00b7 THE FACE**\n\n*communion*\n\nRev 21:3 \u00b7 22:4\nthe word ends in face-to-face\nthe arc closes",
   "x": 2310,
   "y": 0,
   "width": 280,
   "height": 220,
   "color": "4"
  },
  {
   "id": "09f488931c0b4045",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**THE ARC**\n\nvoice \u2192 law \u2192 prophet \u2192 silence \u2192 person \u2192 spirit \u2192 face\n\nthe same question at every phase: *who is God?* \u2014 answered by a name, then stamps, then a person, then a face",
   "x": 660,
   "y": 320,
   "width": 1000,
   "height": 140,
   "color": "3"
  },
  {
   "id": "fd926dde99164918",
